prevent blocking the Event Loop?


I avoid performing CPU-intensive or synchronous operations on the main thread because they can block the Node.js event loop.
I use asynchronous APIs instead of synchronous methods, and for CPU-heavy operations I use Worker Threads or background jobs. 
I also use streams for processing large files instead of loading everything into memory, and 
I monitor event-loop lag in production



