To find memory leaks, I first reproduce the issue by repeatedly mounting and unmounting the component or 
navigating between pages. Then I use Chrome DevTools Memory tab and take heap snapshots before and after the operation, 
forcing garbage collection where appropriate.

To prevent them, I clean up resources in the useEffect cleanup function. For example, 
I use clearInterval, removeEventListener, unsubscribe from subscriptions, close WebSockets, disconnect observers, 
and abort requests when appropriate

